    <body>
      <head type="inscription"><pb n="1"/>INCIPIT CONCILIVM SAMPLIENSE</head>
      <div type="preface">
        <p>Cum in nomine domini conuenissent episcopi in ciuitate <placeName ref="#new_place_Samplia"
            >Sampliensi</placeName>, haec statuerunt.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="chapter" n="1">
        <head type="number">I.</head>
        <head type="rubric">De episcopis.</head>
        <p>Placuit ut episcopi in ciuitatibus suis maneant, <cit><ref>sicut <persName
                ref="#new_person_Paul">apostolus</persName> ait:</ref> <quote source="1TI_3_2">oportet
              episcopum inreprehensibilem esse</quote></cit>.<note type="source"
            source="C.NIC-0325_15"/></p>
      </div>
      <div type="chapter" n="2">
        <head type="number">Cap. II.</head>
        <head type="rubric">De clericis peregrinis.</head>
        <div type="unit">
          <p>Clerici sine litteris episcopi sui non suscipiantur.</p>
        </div>
        <div type="unit">
          <p><seg type="formula">Si quis autem</seg> fecerit, communione priuetur.<note type="source"
              source="cf_C.ANT-0341_6">(cf. Antioch. c. 6)</note></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div type="chapter" n="2a">
        <head type="rubric">De eadem re.</head>
        <p>Idem de <del>diaconibus</del> <subst><del>monachis</del><add place="above"
            >monachis</add></subst> seruetur.<note type="editorial">A chapter without a number in the
            edition.</note></p>
      </div>
      <div type="subscriptions">
        <div type="unit">
          <p><persName ref="#new_person_Exemplus">Exemplus</persName> episcopus subscripsi.</p>
        </div>
        <div type="unit">
          <p><persName ref="#new_person_Specimen">Specimen</persName> episcopus <unclear
              reason="damage">subscripsi</unclear>.<gap reason="omitted"/></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div type="closer">
        <head type="rubric">EXPLICIT CONCILIVM SAMPLIENSE</head>
      </div>
